                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2255d3b7-f713-43cd-b80b-4a545c16b6c4",
                                                "sense_id": "b5856c5e-9f9b-3567-a199-97692240830c",
                                                "text": "Clearly, if pornographers could still use the name without any sexual connotation in the late-nineteenth century, it is likely that many conventional writers in this period were completely unaware that fanny carried a sexual meaning."
